{
  "_comment": "P1.AIVideo — PuLID-FLUX INITIAL (text-to-image) workflow. No identity reference exists yet, so this is plain FLUX.1-dev txt2img used to PROPOSE candidate faces for a new character. Placeholders: __PROMPT__ __SEED__ __WIDTH__ __HEIGHT__ __STEPS__. (FLUX ignores CFG/negative the same way SD does — kept minimal.) See README for model placement.",
